                        <div id="page-title">
                            中国分部异常项目
                        </div>
                    

                    

                    



                    <div id="page-content">
                        

<p><strong>前言：</strong>SCP基金会中国分部发现了为数不少的项目无用而不值得进一步关注。本文件列出了那些激起了一些好奇心的项目。如果这些项目的知识在将来变得有用或必要，则可以将其作为一种资源。<br />
— █████博士，Site-CN-██研究主管</p>
<p>欲查看已归档的异常项目记录，请<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn-arc">点击这里</a>。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p style="text-align: center;"><a class="button create-button" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00476/parentPage/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/#_editpage">添加新的记录</a></p>
</div>
    
    
    
    </div>
<p style="text-align: center;">显示顺序：<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating%20desc">评分较高</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating">评分较低</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name">最早发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name%20desc">最新发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/random">随机</a></p>
<p><strong>提示：</strong>如果你希望改变你的评分，请先点击“X”取消你的评分，再重新评分。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00068/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一盘石磨，材质为石膏，上面雕刻有一个投币口和一句话“收件人：阴间礼部张书吏”，投进去一角钱，就会自动转三分钟。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██省石料厂<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于Site-CN-██的休息室中，允许员工投币自磨豆浆。投进去的硬币将作为捐赠款。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>“有钱能使鬼推磨。”这话一点也不假，哼，这玩意儿一定是鬼造的</em>——Dr.shadeoi<br />
<em>我们喝豆浆都喝吐了，所以我们不会再投币了，不会！</em>——特工EVIL</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00068" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00068" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00068-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/steven-the-shadow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6316800); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6316800&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607177543" alt="Steven the shadow" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6316800)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/steven-the-shadow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6316800); return false;">Steven the shadow</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587022723 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 Apr 2020 07:38</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00059/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">一支法制MAS36步枪，质感异常柔软且具有麦香味</span>一条法式长棍面包，具有认知危害，可使任何观察到该项目的人类认为该项目是一支法制MAS36步枪。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-21员工食堂<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>已被食用<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>今日乳法</em>——Dr.Jackson</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00059" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00059" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00059-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4546338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607177543" alt="miku1314" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4546338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;">miku1314</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1586756541 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">13 Apr 2020 05:42</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00362/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<strong>项目描述：</strong>一个箱子，在面对猫科动物时似乎拥有无限内存，并持续吸引目击项目的猫科动物跳入其中。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██市██宠物店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">保存在SITE-CN-81低价值物品保存柜中。</span>已损坏<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">访问监控录像20██/██/██，██：██：██</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">权限接受</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Dr.Drew:这个箱子肯定没被清理过，那如果我把那根驱逐猫的黄瓜扔进去会怎么样呢？<br />
[数据损坏]</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<strong>附录：</strong>20██/██/██，Dr.Drew将一根00361丢入00362中，在不到一秒间超过█████只不同品种的猫喷涌而出，造成经济损失超过█████元，超过██个异常项目被毁，Dr.Drew侥幸不死，一切损失将由Dr.Drew承担。
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00362" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00362" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00362-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6441401&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607177543" alt="zeta-9-beta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6441401)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;">zeta-9-beta</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1597578736 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 Aug 2020 11:52</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00211/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>项目为Site-CN-10厕所中的部分门锁。在有人进入时有一定几率自动反锁并一段时间内无法在保持锁体完好状况下使用外力打开，当进入对象进入极度绝望状态下将自动打开。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-10的厕所<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>已被更换<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>我终于知道为什么站点里的女员工都会怪力了</em>——特工Accipiter</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00211" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00211" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00211-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aurora-owl" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6126100); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6126100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607177543" alt="Dr Aurora Owl" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6126100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aurora-owl" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6126100); return false;">Dr Aurora Owl</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589848038 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">19 May 2020 00:27</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00308/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<strong>项目描述：</strong>一个水杯，任何使用其饮用液体的生物在液体饮用完毕后均会将其吸在嘴上。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.阙的家中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>在一次抢救中被拆解，重新组装后项目失去异常。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">真相</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Dr.阙把它吸到嘴上拿不下来了，你真该看看他那紫色的嘴唇&#8230;&#8230;哈ha</p>

</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">这不是你该看的</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">这不是你该看的</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><tt><span style="color:white">老子就是要看，真正的文档就在上面</span></tt></p>

</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00308" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00308" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00308-hovertip">
